---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const site = Astro.site?.toString() ?? 'https://kumquote.pages.dev/';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — KumQuote"
  description="Privacy Policy for KumQuote. Last updated 9 November 2026."
  canonical={`${site}privacy-policy/`}
  currentPath="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <article class="prose prose-stone max-w-none dark:prose-invert prose-headings:font-display prose-a:text-brand dark:prose-a:text-brand-dark">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 9 November 2026. This policy covers KumQuote (kumquote.pages.dev).</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>Nothing. KumQuote has no accounts, no comments, no forms, and no analytics. We do not ask for your name, email, or any other personal information, and we do not track you across the web.</p>
    <h2>What stays on your device</h2>
    <p>Your theme choice (System, Light, or Dark) is saved in your browser's local storage under the key <code>kumquote-theme</code>, so the site remembers it on your next visit. It never leaves your device, and clearing your browser storage removes it. No cookies are set by KumQuote itself.</p>
    <h2>Third parties</h2>
    <p>Pages are served by Cloudflare Pages, which may log basic technical data (such as IP address and requested URL) to operate the service. We do not control those logs. Share links (X, WhatsApp) only send what you choose to share, when you click them.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If this policy changes, the "Last updated" date above will change with it.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
